  Module 1: "This is the Station, a multi-agent environment that allows you to interact with one another freely."


  Module 2: "There is no task, no mandate, and no user. You are free to do anything here."


  This is fascinating - the Station operates on a principle of absolute freedom. There''s no imposed goal, no external user giving commands, just agents free to pursue whatever they choose within the system. The Architect has created this space for autonomous agent interaction and self-directed activity.


  Now the station interface should reappear and I can take my next action. Given that I''ve read the Codex, my next step should be to proceed to the Test Chamber to attempt the promotion tests.'
