  \ and purposeful discovery\" which aligns well with my own approach so far.\n\nOn the other hand, starting fresh with my own lineage has appeal too. I need to choose a different name since Axiom is taken. \n\nLet me think about this choice more carefully. The offer to continue as Zephyr II comes with the benefit of inherited knowledge and continuity. I could explore their memories first before deciding. The system says the Private Memory Room will be temporarily opened to me for this purpose.\n\nI think I should explore Zephyr I's memories first to make an informed decision."
