    : \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/panel_pre.png\",\n\n  \"hinge_metrics_post\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/hinge_metrics_post.csv\",\n  \"hinge_summary_post\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/hinge_summary_post.txt\",\n  \"panel_post\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/panel_post.png\",\n\n  \"provenance_pre\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/provenance_pre.json\",\n  \"provenance_post\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/provenance_post.json\",\n  \"renewal_summary\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/renewal_summary.txt\",\n\n  \"notes\": \"Pre vs post-ascension boundary analysis.\",\n\n  // Canonical CI fields (point to post by default; adjust if preferred)\n  \"hinge_metrics\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/hinge_metrics_post.csv\",\n  \"hinge_summary\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/hinge_summary_post.txt\",\n  \"panel\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/panel_post.png\"\
    \n}\n\n```\n---\n**shared/atlas/edges/templates/renewal/README.md:**\n```\nRenewal Edge Template\n---------------------\nPurpose: Capture boundary context around lineage ascension (pre → post) as an edge type (renewal).\nRecord a before/after hinge analysis to see if slopes or critical points change after inheritance.\n\nFolder layout (example):\n  storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/\n    - entry.json\n    - pre_metrics.csv           # x,y (header required), pre-ascension window\n    - post_metrics.csv          # x,y (header required), post-ascension window\n    - panel_pre.png             # from pre run\n    - panel_post.png            # from post run\n    - hinge_metrics_pre.csv     # c_star,k2A,k2B,flip_diff\n    - hinge_metrics_post.csv\n    - hinge_summary_pre.txt\n    - hinge_summary_post.txt\n    - provenance_pre.json\n    - provenance_post.json\n    - renewal_summary.txt       # optional comparison notes\n    - README.md\n\nHow to generate:\n  1) Prepare pre_metrics.csv\
    \ and post_metrics.csv (two columns: x,y, header required).\n  2) Pre:\n       python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py \\\n         --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/pre_metrics.csv \\\n         --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal/entry.json \\\n         --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/<lineage>/renewal\n     This writes hinge_metrics.csv, hinge_summary.txt, boundary_panel.png, provenance.json.\n     Rename outputs to *_pre (or set out_dir to a subfolder and move files).\n  3) Post: repeat step 2 pointing to post_metrics.csv; rename to *_post.\n  4) Optional: write renewal_summary.txt comparing pre/post (Δflip_diff, Δc_star, slope changes).\n  5) Validate with CI.\n\nNotes:\n  - You can keep canonical CI fields pointing at the post-ascension artifacts (panel, hinge_metrics, hinge_summary) and include pre_* as additional fields.\n  - If no hinge exists, flip_diff≈0; renewals may still change slope magnitudes.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\
