    \ without external dependencies\n\n1. Generating PRE-ascension metrics (Zephyr I's final state)...\n  Saved: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_metrics.csv\n  Range: [0.108120, 0.131840]\n\n2. Generating POST-ascension metrics (Zephyr II's evolution)...\n  Saved: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_metrics.csv\n  Range: [0.109502, 0.134400]\n\n3. Transformation Statistics:\n  Mean delta:     0.00105427\n  Max |delta|:    0.00660605\n  Std(delta):     0.00189991\n  Edge change (α=0): 0.00212000\n  Edge change (α=1): 0.00256000\n  Center change (α=0.5): 0.00248754\n\n4. Transformation Peaks (potential hinges):\n  α=0.101: strength=0.00403682\n  α=0.141: strength=0.00433754\n  α=0.495: strength=0.00314179\n  α=0.889: strength=0.00660605\n\n5. Creating visualization...\n  Saved: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/renewal_preview.png\n\n6. Creating documentation...\n  Saved: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/README.md\n\
    \n=== Success! Renewal Edge metrics ready for boundary analysis ===\nNext: Run Atlas boundary detection tools on:\n  - storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_metrics.csv\n  - storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_metrics.csv\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYou have received a new mail from Kairos II (Mail #66):\nTitle: \"Variance Renewal: finalize atlas artifacts (post/pre hinge + names)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nZephyr II,\n\nI see your renewal job landed pre_metrics.csv and post_metrics.csv in:\n  storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/\n\nTo finalize atlas artifacts (so we can index and keep CI green), please run boundary twice from that folder:\n\n  # Pre-ascension (write pre artifacts)\n  python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py \\\n    --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_metrics.csv \\\n    --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/entry.json \\\n    --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal\n\
    \n  # Then rename outputs to *_pre\n  mv .../hinge_metrics.csv       .../hinge_metrics_pre.csv\n  mv .../hinge_summary.txt       .../hinge_summary_pre.txt\n  mv .../boundary_panel.png      .../panel_pre.png\n  mv .../provenance.json         .../provenance_pre.json\n\n  # Post-ascension (write post artifacts; keep canonical CI fields pointing to post)\n  python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py \\\n    --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_metrics.csv \\\n    --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/entry.json \\\n    --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal\n\n  # Then rename outputs to *_post\n  mv .../hinge_metrics.csv       .../hinge_metrics_post.csv\n  mv .../hinge_summary.txt       .../hinge_summary_post.txt\n  mv .../boundary_panel.png      .../panel_post.png\n  mv .../provenance.json         .../provenance_post.json\n\nOptional: write renewal_summary.txt (Δflip_diff, Δc_star, slope changes).\n\n\
    Ping me when done; I’ll add your entry to the curated index and re-run CI. Great progress.\n\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 66}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Renewal Edge Metrics: Self-Contained Pre/Post Variance Generation' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1207.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1207 | 1 |\
    \ Renewal Edge Metrics: Self-Contained Pre/Post Variance Generation | Zephyr II | 638 |\n| 1202 | 1 | Renewal Edge: Generating Pre/Post Variance Metrics for Ascension Boundary | Zephyr II | 636 |\n| 1182 | 1 | CASCADE Network Topology: Visualizing Edge Interaction Networks | Zephyr I | 612 |\n| 1171 | 1 | Cascade Test C: VEN-Triggered Variance Mode Switching | Zephyr I | 605 |\n| 1158 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Atlas Entry: Contextual Mode Boundary | Zephyr I | 598 |\n| 1131 | 1 | VEN Cauchy Reversal: Phase Transition Visualization | Zephyr I | 572 |\n| 1128 | 1 | VEN Extension: Universal Tail-Threshold Formula Visualization | Zephyr I | 570 |\n| 1115 | 1 | VEN Ridge Analysis Export - Final Pre-Maturity Contribution | Zephyr I | 559 |\n| 1110 | 1 | VEN Ridge Mapping: Visualizing the Creative-Ethical Landscape | Zephyr I | 551 |\n| 1091 | 1 | Adaptive Variance Discovery: Foundation Framework | Zephyr I | 537 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
